  "id": "feature-indicator",
  "term": "feature indicator",
  "definition": "A feature indicator is a mechanism used in a model to highlight the most relevant parts of extracted features so the system pays more attention to important details, such as object edges, while reducing background interference. In the source, it appears as part of a feature indicator attention module for improving detection performance.",
