      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports a Feature Indicator Attention (FIA) module, not a standalone ‘feature indicator’ mechanism as defined here, so the sense of the term is broadened beyond the source wording.",
        "The opening generalization about ‘the most relevant parts of extracted features’ is an interpretation; the packet specifically says the module dynamically focuses on multi-scale insulator edges and suppresses background interference, not a general feature-selection mechanism.",
        "The phrase ‘for improving detection performance’ is only indirectly supported by the reported experiment results and is not presented in the source as part of the term’s definition."
